      "releaseNotes": "• Recurring tasks: set any task with a due date to repeat (hourly, daily, weekdays, weekends, weekly, biweekly, monthly, every 3 or 6 months, yearly, or a custom interval). Completing one automatically creates the next occurrence in the same project and column\n• Alert Until Done: a new option that re-sends a notification every hour after a task is due, until you complete or delete it\n• Cleaner notifications: alerts now show just the task name with the due time underneath\n• Keyboard navigation on Mac and iPad: use arrow keys to move between tasks and columns, hold Shift or Option to select multiple tasks, press Return to open a task, and Escape to close it\n• VoiceOver support across boards, lists, and task details\n• Task Details is now available from the right-click or long-press menu on any task\n• Major sync reliability improvements, including a fix for task notes, links, and images not syncing across devices\n• New sync status in Settings shows your iCloud connection, recent activity, and any problems in plain language\n• The app now keeps a daily on-device backup of your data as a safety net\n• Fixed a bug where notes could display as one letter per line\n• Fixed horizontal scrolling on Mac: the scroll bar is now visible so all columns are always reachable",
      "primaryGenreName": "Productivity",
      "primaryGenreId": 6007,
