      "currency": "USD",
      "description": "Organize your work into Spaces and Projects, then move tasks across the columns you define. Every card shows what matters at a glance: a cover image, subtitle, tags, priority, and due date. Open any task and you get a full markdown notes editor with headings, lists, checkboxes, images, and file attachments.\n\nORGANIZE YOUR WAY\n\n• Kanban boards with drag-and-drop cards, columns, and dividers\n• A list view for every project, with drag to reorder\n• Spaces group your projects; tags cut across them\n• Smart lists for Inbox, Today, Upcoming, and Flagged\n• Archive completed work, or keep it crossed out on the board\n\nCAPTURE THE DETAILS\n\n• Rich notes on every task: headings, bold, lists, to-do checkboxes, quotes, and code\n• Attach images and files right in the note\n• Cover images, subtitles, priorities, flags, links, and due dates with reminders\n\nEVERYWHERE YOU WORK\n\n• Native on Mac, iPhone, iPad, and Apple Vision Pro\n• iCloud sync keeps every device up to date\n• Spotlight search and Shortcuts actions!\n• Multi-select to move, complete, or delete tasks in bulk\n• Light and Dark appearance, color themes, adjustable typography\n\nNo accounts. No subscriptions to manage your own tasks. Your data lives in your iCloud.",
